{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組選舉結果陸續公布，金融服務界17名當選人分別是鄧聲興、汪俊紅、楊玳詩、李細燕、陳銘潤、張德熙、唐桂坤、陳立德、鄔奇、明小冲、伍子權、熊力頲、李耀新、龔臻虹、陳柏楠、林向紅、李彤。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:43:50.717819+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T14:05:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T14:37:28.265246+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T14:37:28.265246+00:00","content_hash":"5ecb1b99d763053988510d43aec62a6b875f49a7f29424826b587bdc37009330","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}